          <cite>From the afterword</cite>
        </blockquote>

        <p class="body">Twelve years of image-making collected in one volume — the series, the
          failures kept on purpose, and the archive they were built from. Published by gestalten
          in 2025, with prefaces by the photographer Lynn Goldsmith and the composer
